  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"(", 
    SuperscriptBox["e", "\[Mu]"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d447e04e-1ce7-6e4f-a3fe-322fb34edabd"],
 ")_{a} that a is the row of matrix e and \[Mu] is the four elements of each \
inverse tetrad"
}], "Text",
